# There is deliberately no `lib/` rule here. It was blanket-ignoring three
# directories of real source -- apps/web/lib, apps/extension/scripts/lib, and
# the Foundry dependencies -- which meant commits that looked complete did not
# build from a fresh clone. Foundry deps are pinned submodules now, so nothing
# under any lib/ needs ignoring. Do not reintroduce the pattern.

